---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Online Linux Terminal"
  description="Privacy Policy for Online Linux Terminal (onlinelinuxterminal.com). Learn how browser IndexedDB data and cookies are handled."
  keywords="online linux terminal privacy policy, online linux terminal privacy, terms and privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-zinc-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-100 font-sans">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Effective Date: August 19, 2026</p>
      <p>
        At OnlineLinuxTerminal.com, accessible from https://onlinelinuxterminal.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">Local Browser Storage</h2>
      <p>
        All terminal session data, file system modifications, and command histories created within the Online Linux Terminal sandbox are stored locally in your browser's IndexedDB and localStorage. We do not transmit or store your terminal session files on remote servers.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">Cookies & Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We may use third-party advertising partners like Google AdSense to serve non-intrusive ads on content pages to support free access to the terminal tool.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
